# Deployment Checklist

## Pre-deploy

1. Run the full test suite: `npm test`
2. Verify database migrations are up to date
3. Check environment variables in `.env.production`

## Deploy Steps

- [ ] Tag the release: `git tag v2.4.1`
- [ ] Push to origin: `git push --tags`
- [ ] Monitor CI/CD pipeline for failures
- [ ] Verify health check endpoint returns `200 OK`

## Rollback

If issues are detected within 15 minutes of deploy:

```bash
kubectl rollout undo deployment/web-api --to-revision=3
```

> **Note:** Always notify the on-call engineer before rolling back.
